plications in sequence processing tasks.\n   - **Transfer Learning**: Familiarity with pre-trained models and how to fine-tune them for specific tasks.\n   - **Model Evaluation and Hyperparameter Tuning**: Skills in evaluating model performance using relevant metrics and techniques like grid search and randomized search for hyperparameter optimization.\n\nBy prioritizing these essential concepts, you will establish a strong foundation in the fundamentals of Deep Learning, enabling you to more effectively grasp and apply advanced techniques and technologies in the field.": 7.1875,
